<section class="research-section">

<div class="research-box">

<h2>Research Objective</h2>

<p>

This research explores how organizations use social media to promote Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) initiatives. It examines how digital platforms increase transparency, customer engagement, and brand reputation while encouraging sustainable business practices.

</p>

</div>

<div class="research-box">

<h2>Research Findings</h2>

<ul>

<li>Social media increases CSR awareness.</li>

<li>CSR campaigns improve customer trust.</li>

<li>Video content receives higher engagement.</li>

<li>Visual storytelling improves campaign reach.</li>

<li>Consistent CSR communication strengthens brand reputation.</li>

</ul>

</div>

